From: lucascouts <lucascs@protonmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 02:59:46 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] ui, theme: rustfmt the story-002 test files

The pre-authored tests were written by hand at plan time and never passed
through rustfmt, so they were the only files story 002 added to the repo's
fmt-check failure. Layout only: rewrapped call arguments and the trailing commas
rustfmt adds when it explodes a call across lines.

No literal changed -- every string and every numeric expectation is byte-identical
before and after -- so no assertion moved. The suite reports the same 180 passing
tests it did before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
